{"numberOfHits":1,"results":[{"id":"GO:0001503","isObsolete":false,"name":"ossification","definition":{"text":"The formation of bone or of a bony substance, or the conversion of fibrous tissue or of cartilage into bone or a bony substance.","xrefs":[{"dbCode":"PMID","dbId":"17572649"}]},"comment":"Note that this term does not have a 'developmental process' parent because ossification isn't necessarily developmental, can also occur as part of bone remodeling. Instead use 'ossification involved in bone maturation ; GO:0043931'.","synonyms":[{"name":"bone biosynthesis","type":"exact"},{"name":"bone formation","type":"exact"},{"name":"osteogenesis","type":"exact"}],"children":[{"id":"GO:0045778","relation":"positively_regulates"},{"id":"GO:0036075","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0001649","relation":"part_of"},{"id":"GO:0030278","relation":"regulates"},{"id":"GO:0030279","relation":"negatively_regulates"},{"id":"GO:0036072","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0043932","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0036077","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0030282","relation":"part_of"},{"id":"GO:0043931","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0036076","relation":"is_a"}],"history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-02","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2026-07-02","action":"Deleted","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2026-07-02","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2026-07-02","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2026-07-02","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2026-07-02","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2024-03-05","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2020-02-28","action":"Deleted","category":"XREF","text":"MIPS_funcat:45.03.05.07"},{"timestamp":"2020-02-28","action":"Deleted","category":"XREF","text":"MIPS_funcat:41.05.17"},{"timestamp":"2019-05-